		'Cap any pre-nominal modifier at roughly 12 Chinese characters and never stack three 的 in one chain — 构建测试系统的团队提供的设备健康分析 is the most reliable MT tell in Chinese. Name the noun first and explain after it (系统专为…定制设计，满足…, not 针对…定制设计的系统), or split off a predicate clause (设备健康分析由打造这些测试系统的团队直接提供), or use a Chinese verb instead of 来自……的 (这一有效工具输出的数据) — keeping every modifier and the verb\'s valence exactly as neutral as the source. Read the result aloud: if two adjacent characters fuse into an unintended word (需要大规模可靠 → 大规模可靠), rebuild with a separate clause (在大规模生产中). Credential chains (X 大学 Y 专业学士学位) are exempt.',
